        "predicate": [],
        "description": "<p>Effect: The user may distribute 12 Christmas Presents within Line of Sight. When a creature collects a Christmas Present, the user may freely use the Special Delivery variant of the move Present as an @Trait[interrupt] on the target, with the @Trait[danger-close] trait added.</p><p>If the user is an @Trait[ace] or Owned Creature, 3 Luck may be spent to re-roll the results of Present (Special Delivery).</p>",
